      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Fixing the debt is a myth, a desperate fantasy you cling to. You can't undo the mud or the screams, only the pain you inflict on yourself by trying. True atonement isn't in some grand gesture, but in the quiet cessation of that burden. Stop trying to be a shield; just find a way to stop being the source of the damage.",
